# Bard's Company: "You may cast this spell as though it had flash if you control a Human", "Other creatures you control get +1/+1" and
# "Whenever this creature enters or attacks, recruit." Bot1 controls an Eager Cadet (a Human) and flashes the Company in during
# Bot2's turn-2 upkeep. It enters, Bot1 recruits (draws the Ornithopter, discards it: a Human Soldier token), the Cadet and the token
# are 2/2s, the Company itself a 2/3, and Bot2's Ornithopter is not pumped. On turn 3 the Company attacks and recruits again:
# Bot1 draws the second Ornithopter and discards a Plains, so no second token.

